# 经典系统动力学原型：耕地-水土流失（Soil Erosion，农业生态教科书公有领域模型）
graph "耕地水土流失"

var farming "耕作强度"
var vegetation "植被覆盖"
var erosion "水土流失"
var soil_quality "土壤质量"
var crop_yield "亩产"
var abandonment "弃耕"

farming -> + crop_yield @loops R1
crop_yield -> + farming @loops R1,B2
farming -> - vegetation @loops B2,B3
vegetation -> - erosion @loops B2,B3
erosion -> - soil_quality @loops B2
soil_quality -> + crop_yield @loops B2
erosion -> + abandonment @loops B3
abandonment -> - farming @loops B3

loop R1 "短期增产回路" "R" [farming, crop_yield]
loop B2 "地力衰减回路" "B" [farming, vegetation, erosion, soil_quality, crop_yield]
loop B3 "弃耕退出回路" "B" [farming, vegetation, erosion, abandonment]
